    "detailed_description": "EN:<br />\r\nPeak Climb VR will bring you an action-packed full-time professional climbing experience and give you exciting moments. While every part of this experience will entertain you, it will also provide you with a tiring calorie burn and game music will provide you with spiritual therapy.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Peak Climb VR A New Generation Climbing Game. The calories of each part are calculated. Doing your daily movement activities in brand new landscapes will motivate you even more. We prepared the music for this game using 800 years of GevherNesibe experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTR:<br />\r\nPeak Climb VR size aksiyon dolu tam zamanl\u0131 profesyonel bir t\u0131rman\u0131\u015f deneyimi ya\u015fatacak ve size heyecan verici anlar ya\u015fatacak. Bu deneyimin her b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fc sizi e\u011flendirirken ayn\u0131 zamanda kalori yakman\u0131z\u0131 sa\u011flayacak ve oyun m\u00fczi\u011fi size ruhsal terapi sa\u011flayacakt\u0131r.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Peak Climb VR Yeni Nesil T\u0131rmanma Oyunu. Her par\u00e7an\u0131n kalorisi hesaplan\u0131r. G\u00fcnl\u00fck hareket aktivitelerinizi yepyeni manzaralarda yapmak sizi daha da motive edecektir. 800 y\u0131ll\u0131k GevherNesibe tecr\u00fcbesini kullanarak bu oyunun m\u00fczi\u011fini haz\u0131rlad\u0131k.",
